==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 14 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

This is roughly where difficulty starts to ramp up in the Aku Realms. [[True Form]]s, [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Gacha Cats]] or [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] will be very important in this and future stages.

The presence of wave attackers makes it so the level cap greatly matters. Unlike many previous stages, you will have to deal with enemies that can hit a chunk of your army, so the lower the magnification, the more hits each Pigeon will land and the stronger each hit will be, making the penalty for a low level cap so much more punishing. Luckily, just around the recommended level cap, [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] becomes strong enough to realistically kill Pigeons before they get a chance to hit; consistently even, if 2 or more Legs are present.

